  "about": {
    "zh": "薄荷绿色全息电子脸，近方形屏幕、扫描线、像素高光和悬浮机械方块。没有手指和手腕。表情连续形变，眼睛、嘴和方块都不会瞬间换图。可沿屏幕左右边缘攀爬，最高停在屏幕三分之二高度；长时间无操作时休眠；明显摔落后暂时缩小并出现机械泪痕。高风扇读数时微红、显示机械绿焰和使劲表情；风扇不可读时用持续 CPU/GPU 高负载近似触发。任务真实失败时用大哭，确认成功或用户夸奖时用致敬；根据上下文判断，不把每个工具结束都当成任务成功。",
    "en": "A mint holographic face with a nearly square screen, scanlines, pixel highlights and floating square mechanical modules, without fingers or wrists. Expressions morph continuously. It climbs the screen sides up to two thirds of the height, sleeps during prolonged inactivity, and temporarily shrinks with circuit-like tears after a hard user-thrown landing. High fan readings add a red tint, green digital exhaust and a straining face; sustained CPU/GPU load is the fallback when fan data is unavailable. For actual task failure use cry; for confirmed success or explicit praise use salute. Judge the context; an individual tool finishing is not by itself task success."
  },
